{
    "name": "tiki/tiki",
    "description": "Tiki Wiki CMS Groupware",
    "license": "LGPL-2.1-only",
    "homepage": "https://tiki.org",
    "minimum-stability": "RC",
    "_comment": [
        "Yes, that's the only way to do comments",
        "  https://github.com/composer/composer/issues/5364",
        "",
        "In case of a manual update of the dependencies list, please ensure the list stays alphabetically sorted.",
        "",
        "How to update dependencies",
        "  satis and composer.tiki.org",
        "    First, make sure the version you want is covered by ",
        "    doc/devtools/statis.json,  as that's what makes the ",
        "    package available on composer.tiki.org",
        "  check composer.json: ",
        "    composer -d vendor_bundled update --dry-run",
        "  update composer.lock: ",
        "    composer -d vendor_bundled update",
        "  Useful to look at: ",
        "    composer -d vendor_bundled outdated",
        "  This is what setup.sh runs: ",
        "    composer -d vendor_bundled install --prefer-dist #In dev mode",
        "    composer -d vendor_bundled install --prefer-dist --no-dev #In release mode",
        "",
        "DIRECT PHP PACKAGE DEPENDENCIES NOTES:",
        "",
        "  garethp/php-ews: ",
        "    Overrides minimum-stability for this Cypht dependency until it releases a stable version.",
        "",
        "  monolog/monolog:",
        "    We use version ^2.0 instead of ^3.0 because Monolog 3 requires psr/log ^2.0 or ^3.0,",
        "    while montefuscolo/xmpp still depends on psr/log version 1, causing a conflict.",
        "    Monolog 2 is compatible with psr/log version 1, so it works without issues for now.",
        "",
        "  paragonie/sodium_compat: ",
        "    This is https://github.com/paragonie/sodium_compat",
        "    A pure php polyfill for ",
        "    https://www.php.net/manual/en/sodium.installation.php",
        "    Sodium is a core extension since php 7.2",
        "    + we seem to actually check for it in tiki-check.php",
        "    + we have alternate code paths in lib/crypt/cryptlib.php",
        "    Security critical, aparently uninitialised code",
        "    Should probably be removed. benoitg 2023-05-05",
        "",
        "  sentry/sdk",
        "    Provides the Sentry namespace",
        "    Used for our Glitchtip integration to catch PHP errors",
        "    Initialised by lib/setup/errortracking.php when ",
        "    error_tracking_enabled_php is set",
        "",
        "  steverhoades/oauth2-openid-connect-client:",
        "    Provides namespace OpenIDConnectClient",
        "    Used by lib/OpenIdConnectLib.php",
        "  symfony/finder: ",
        "    provides Symfony\\Component\\Finder",
        "    Used by phpunit, but also lib/core/Tiki/Package and lib/setup/theme.php",
        "  symfony/process: ",
        "    provides Symfony\\Component\\Process",
        "    Used by Tiki\\Process, phpunit",
        "  symfony/yaml: ",
        "    provides Symfony\\Component\\Yaml",
        "    Used throughout tiki",
        "",
        "  zf1s/zend-service-akismet:",
        "    Maintained fork of zendframework/zendservice-akismet, ",
        "    which upstream avandonned in 2019.",
        "    Provides ZendService\\Akismet\\Akismet which is only used by lib/comments/commentslib.php.",
        "    A more actively maintained alternative would be ",
        "    https://github.com/gsteel/akismet, but would require code changes",
        "",
        "  pear/xml_rpc: has been replaced by phpxmlrpc/phpxmlrpc.",
        "",
        "NOTABLE TRANSITIVE DEPENDENCIES NOTES:",
        "  Try to document here packages that:",
        "    -  Are here just to lock the version used by another package",
        "    -  Are not here, but are noteworthy when installed transitively:",
        "      - ABANDONNED packages installed transitively",
        "",
        "  php-http/message-factory: ",
        "    ABANDONNED package.",
        "    Required transitively by sentry/sdk",
        "",
        "  symfony/*",
        "    Upgrading:  ",
        "    Rector always has rules to refactors Symfony code ",
        "    automatically.  See rector.php",
        "    Symfony does not maintain a master branch.",
        "    However, they do maintain a CHANGELOG.mg  for EACH ",
        "    of their components to see what's changed; ex:",
        "    symfony/routing: https://github.com/symfony/symfony/blob/7.1/src/Symfony/Component/Routing/CHANGELOG.md",
        "    symfony/process: https://github.com/symfony/symfony/blob/7.1/src/Symfony/Component/Process/CHANGELOG.md",
        "",
        "WE DECIDED NOT TO PORT THE JAVASCRIPT BUILD SYSTEM:",
        "  The following libraries have not been ported to the new build system for the following reasons: (for each library, please explains its reasons):",
        "    - 'openannotation/annotator': '>=1.2.10'",
        "       - Reasons: On NPM, the only release version is 1.2.2, please use this commande npm view annotator versions" ,
        "                  With 1.2.2 version, these files annotator-full.min.js and annotator.min.css are missing",
        "                  After running npm install, we get this warning messages :",
        "                      npm warn EBADENGINE Unsupported engine {",
        "                      npm warn EBADENGINE   package: 'annotator@2.0.0-dev.2'",
        "                      npm warn EBADENGINE   required: { node: '>=0.8 <0.12' }",
        "                      npm warn EBADENGINE   current: { node: 'v20.15.0', npm: '10.7.0' }",
        "                      npm warn EBADENGINE } pay attention on this line required: { node: '>=0.8 <0.12' }, It seems required node version is too low",
        "                  Annotator has already been unmaintained for a decade. No alternative has emerged.",
        "                  1.2.10 hasn't been packaged for npm, and there is no one to package it.",
        "       - Some essential links : https://www.npmjs.com/package/annotator and https://github.com/openannotation/annotator",
        "",
        "     - 'jquery/jquery-sheet': '3.1'",
        "        - Reasons: We are looking for a replacement: https://dev.tiki.org/Replacement-for-WickedGrid-(jQuery.sheet)",
        "",
        "     - 'robicch/jquery-gantt': '^6.3'",
        "        - Reasons: Not available on NPM: https://github.com/robicch/jQueryGantt/issues/115",
        "",
        "     - 'simile_timeline/simile_timeline': '^2.3.0'",
        "        - Reasons: Because the project is inactive, we are looking for a replacement https://simile.mit.edu/timeline/",
        "",
        "     - 'philippemarcmeyer/fieldslinker': '^1.0.3'",
        "        - Reasons: Not available on NPM: https://github.com/PhilippeMarcMeyer/FieldsLinker/issues/34",
        "",
        "     - 'npm-asset/boomerangjs': '^1.687'",
        "        - Reasons: Waiting on upstream: https://gitlab.com/tikiwiki/tiki/-/merge_requests/5566",
        "",
        "DEV DEPENDENCIES NOTES:",
        "",
        "  sebastian/diff: ",
        "    provides SebastianBergmann\\Diff\\Differ",
        "    Used by phpunit and console.php index:compare-engines",
        "",
        "  phpunit/phpunit: ",
        "    Temporarily pinned to 10.5.26, because .27 and .28 cause Message:  Schema for PHPUnit index.php is not available errors",
        ""

    ],
